### Step 1: send the 3 token requests first (user, manager, admin). Step 2: send requests 1-10.

# @name login_user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "user"
}

###

# @name login_manager
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "manager"
}

###

# @name login_admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

###1. USER JWT: GET all -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login_user.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

###2. USER JWT: GET one -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login_user.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

###3. USER JWT: CREATE -> 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login_user.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###4. USER JWT: DELETE -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login_user.response.body.access_token}}

###

###5. MANAGER JWT: CREATE -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login_manager.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###6. MANAGER JWT: UPDATE -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login_manager.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Chelsea",
  "transferFee": 80000000
}

###

###7. MANAGER JWT: DELETE -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login_manager.response.body.access_token}}

###

###8. ADMIN JWT: DELETE -> 200
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login_admin.response.body.access_token}}

###

###9. ADMIN JWT: GET all -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{login_admin.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

###

###10. INVALID JWT: GET all -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value
Accept: application/json

###
